---
title: File check
tags: tools
heading: "Check file type"
---
{% from "macros/tool.njk" import toolSection with context %}
{% set filename = page.fileSlug %}
{% set intro %}
<p class="px-2">
    Select a file to check its file type / header. Only the first 16 bytes of each file are read and then discarded, no files are actually uploaded or stored anywhere.
    Files are matches against the File headers table below and won't catch everything. Feel free to reach out if there's a header missing or one you think would be worth adding.
</p>
{% endset %}
{% call toolSection(intro) %}
<div class="col">
    <div class="card">
        <span class="card-label visually-hidden">Check file headers</span>
        <div class="card-body">
            <div class="mb-3">
                <label for="fileInput" class="form-label visually-hidden">Select a file</label>
                <input class="form-control" type="file" id="fileInput">
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-footer py-3">
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-start align-items-center">
                {% include "components/select-copy-dl.njk" %}
            </div>
            <hr />
            <div id="{{ filename }}Results" class="data-to-copy active convrtr-results"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
{% endcall %}
